<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Non-Infectious Diseases</title>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 20px;
  background: #f0f8f0;
  font-family: Arial;
  text-align: center;
}

h1 {
  color: #2e7d32;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.img-container {
  width: 100%;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 15px;
  margin: 20px 0;
  display: flex;
  gap: 5px;
  padding: 10px;
}

.disease-img {
  width: 380px;
  height: 250px;
  border-radius: 15px;
  animation: slideLeft 10s infinite linear;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

@keyframes slideLeft {
  0% { transform: translateX(0); }
  100% { transform: translateX(-1140px); }
}

.descriptions {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 40px auto;
  display: flex;
  gap: 30px;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.desc-card {
  background: white;
  padding: 25px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 300px;
  border-left: 5px solid #f57c00; /* برتقالي للغير معدية */
}

.desc-title {
  color: #f57c00; /* برتقالي */
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.desc-text {
  color: #555;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.back {
  position: fixed;
  top: 20px;
  left: 20px;
  background: #2e7d32;
  color: white;
  padding: 10px 20px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.back:hover {
  background: #1b5e20;
}

@media (max-width: 1400px) {
  .disease-img {
    width: 330px;
    height: 220px;
    animation: slideLeft 9s infinite linear;
  }
  @keyframes slideLeft {
    100% { transform: translateX(-990px); }
  }
  
  .descriptions {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<a href="ttt.html" class="back">Back</a>

<h1>Non-Infectious Diseases</h1>

<div class="img-container">
  <img src="download (3).webp" class="disease-img" alt="Disease 1">
  <img src="OIP.webp" class="disease-img" alt="Disease 2">
  <img src="download (4).webp" class="disease-img" alt="Disease 3">
  <img src="download (3).webp" class="disease-img" alt="Disease 1">
  <img src="OIP.webp" class="disease-img" alt="Disease 2">
  <img src="download (4).webp" class="disease-img" alt="Disease 3">
</div>

<div class="descriptions">
  <div class="desc-card">
    <h3 class="desc-title">1. Nitrogen Deficiency</h3>
    <p class="desc-text">Yellowing of older leaves starting from tips. Stunted growth and weak stems. Caused by poor soil nitrogen. Treatment: Apply nitrogen-rich fertilizers like urea.</p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="desc-card">
    <h3 class="desc-title">2. Iron Chlorosis</h3>
    <p class="desc-text">Yellowing between leaf veins on young leaves while veins stay green. Common in alkaline soils. Treatment: Chelated iron sprays or soil acidification.</p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="desc-card">
    <h3 class="desc-title">3. Water Stress (Wilting)</h3>
    <p class="desc-text">Drooping leaves and stems due to insufficient water or root damage. Leaves may appear dull. Treatment: Proper watering schedule and improve soil drainage.</p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
